          }
        ],
        "text": "The authors claim that stabilizer work converges to stabilizer nullity as beta tends to infinity and that its leading small-beta magic dependence is a function of the second stabilizer Renyi entropy. They describe a continuous monotonic interpolation, with beta resolving Pauli moments rather than physical temperature. This is an unverified author-claim candidate."
      }
